abstract: >-
  Reproducible archive of a C/Python code-golf experiment implementing the finite TREE(3)
  search. The current verified C entry in this project is 545 characters under the stated
  gcc/x86-64 assumptions, with preserved history, rejected attempts, regression tests,
  sanitizer checks, execution logs, and probability-forecast history.
